<title>BAHRAIN: Faysal Islamic Bank lifts 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Faysal Islamic Bank lifts 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p> Net profit		13.9    vs    12.6</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	  27.4    vs    20.4</p>
<p> dividend		   6.65   vs    nil</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  116.3    vs   100.8</p>
<p> Assets		   356.0    vs   368.1</p>
<p> Customer deposits     20.6    vs    56.7</p>
<p>Full Name: Faysal Islamic Bank of Bahrain E.C.</p>
<p>Note - The Bahrain-based bank is traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
